          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I’m Up and Down, and Round and Round"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.844,
            0.068,
            0.883,
            0.084
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "111"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.108,
            0.725,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Let A and B be two points on a circle with centre O."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.135,
            0.883,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Are there points X, Y on the circle, on the same side of AB,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.225,
            0.157,
            0.661,
            0.176
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "such that ∠AXB is different from ∠AYB?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.182,
            0.661,
            0.223
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Is it true that if "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle AXB = \\angle AHB"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , then X and Y lie on the same side of the circle?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.229,
            0.661,
            0.292
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) If "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle AXB = \\angle AHB"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , and X and Y do not lie on the circle, does the circle through A, B and X also pass through Y?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.671,
            0.159,
            0.884,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": [
            {
